{
  "testCaseId": "TC00010",
  "title": "Personal Auto rating: expected premiums calculated from the rate book for every policy below",
  "notes": [
    "Each entry in policies is quoted in PolicyCenter and validated against the rating engine (utils/paRatingEngine.ts), which rates it with the tables in test-data/rating/pa-rate-book.json.",
    "No expected amount is stored here. Change any input (UW company, vehicle cost, driver ages, limits, deductibles, dates...) and the expected premiums follow.",
    "Preview the calculation without opening PolicyCenter: npm run rating:preview",
    "Run one policy only: npx playwright test tests/tc00010-rating-calculated.spec.ts --project=chromium -g \"TC00010-02\"",
    "rating holds facts the rating needs that are not typed into the UI: garaging ZIP, vehicle type, transaction type and multi-car factor.",
    "Coverage value is the text picked in the UI; the rate-book term value is the same text without commas unless ratingValue is given. Coverage names must match rate-book coverages[].name.",
    "Set enabled to false to skip a policy."
  ],
  "presentation": {
    "enabled": true,
    "typingDelayMs": 120,
    "pauseAfterInputMs": 600,
    "pauseAfterValidationMs": 5000
  },
